DESCRIPTION:At MongoDB\, we have several Django enthusiasts who have jumped
  at the idea of backing a long-term solution to combining MongoDB and Djan
 go. Having historically provided support for SQL-based open source framewo
 rks like Entity Framework in .NET/C#\, Doctrine in PHP\, and many more\, w
 e are familiar with the territory.\nWe're happy to say we've successfully 
 created a MongoDB Backend Library for Django and want to share all that we
 've learned kitting out a new NoSQL backend for a traditionally SQL framew
 ork including how we believe we have influenced -- and will continue to in
 fluence -- changes in the core Django library.
DTSTAMP:20261116T124749Z
LOCATION:Main hall
SUMMARY:Evolving Django: What We Learned by Integrating MongoDB - Anaiya Ra
 isinghani
